|desc=
You learn to maintain your agility and manage your combat posture while wearing light armour.  When wearing armour no heavier than leather in your main body slot, you gain the following bonuses

* [[Saves and To-Hit|Defense]] increased by {{CS|(Talent Level * Dex)|4|0|50|500|0.375}}
* [[Armour|Armour hardiness]] increased by {{CL|(Talent Level * 4)|100%|5|3.75|50%|37.5}}
* [[Fatigue]] reduced by {{CTL|50|10|25%}}

In addition, when you step adjacent to a (visible) enemy, you use the juxtaposition to increase your total defense by {{CS|(Dex * Talent Level)|2|0|25|500|0.375}} for 2 turns.

The Defense bonus scales with your Dexterity.
|avail=Note that both [[Adventurer]] and [[Wanderer]] classes begin with {{c|Combat Training}} unlocked
